{"id":"1ac75150a2814e24","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-alphabet.md","title":"Alphabet","display":"df-alphabet — Alphabet","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-alphabet","aliases":["88-df-alphabet"],"display":"df-alphabet — Alphabet","depends_on":["[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-alphabet"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-alphabet</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-alphabet — Alphabet"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-alphabet-—-Alphabet-$\\Sigma$\">df-alphabet — Alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (candidate symbol set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Sigma|\">\\(|\\Sigma|\\)</span> (cardinality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (alphabet predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Sigma\\neq\\emptyset\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Sigma\\neq\\emptyset\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> : 字母表（非空有限集合）</li>\n<li>字母表是形式语言的最基本组成部分</li>\n<li>所有形式语言中的表达式都由字母表中的符号构成</li>\n</ul>\n<p>字母表通常包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑符号：联结词、量词、等号</li>\n<li>非逻辑符号：常量、函数、谓词符号</li>\n<li>辅助符号：括号、逗号等</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一阶语法使用字母表时另加<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sym}_S\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sym}_S\\)</span>；Turing机字母表\n则由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d60bba0b88c24189\" href=\"?note=d60bba0b88c24189\" title=\"88-df-tm-alphabet\">88-df-tm-alphabet</a>绑定到机器自己的符号编码域。本定义不再调用\n来源中不存在的无下标<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symbol}\">\\(\\mathrm{Symbol}\\)</span>类。</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>：由字母表构造的表达式集合</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>：由字母表符号构成的有意义表达式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-alphabet-—-Alphabet-$\\Sigma$","text":"df-alphabet — Alphabet $\\Sigma$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\Sigma|$ (cardinality, see [[88-df-cardinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d60bba0b88c24189","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一阶语法使用字母表时另加$\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sym}_S$；Turing机字母表\n则由[[88-df-tm-alphabet]]绑定到机器自己的符号编码域。本定义不再调用\n来源中不存在的无下标$\\mathrm{Symbol}$类。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]：由字母表构造的表达式集合","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]：由字母表符号构成的有意义表达式","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Sigma|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}alphabet} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\Sigma\\neq\\emptyset\\land|\\Sigma|<\\aleph_0","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sym}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Symbol}","display":false}],"bytes":1281,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-alphabet]]：通用的有限非空字母表"},{"id":"d60bba0b88c24189","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c412569a8bba638b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom